<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-099" chapter-id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children" source-id="s-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children">
  <p id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:brother" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">隆安中，詔加<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:brother:m0006" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">玄</persName>都督荊州四郡，以兄<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:brother:m0016" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAE">偉</persName>為輔國將軍、南蠻校尉。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">是歲，<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:death:m0003" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">玄</persName>兄<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:death:m0005" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAE">偉</persName>卒，贈開府、驃騎將軍，以<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:death:m0018" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AEC">桓脩</persName>代之。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:xin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:xin:m0000" ref="0f0_dac_95f">魏詠之</persName>破<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:xin:m0004" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAC">桓歆</persName>于曆陽，<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:xin:m0010" ref="1e1_hte_wn0">諸葛長民</persName>又敗<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:xin:m0016" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAC">歆</persName>於芍陂，<persName id="c-jinshu-099-jin098-huan-children:xin:m0021" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAC">歆</persName>單馬渡淮。</p>
</text>
